msgid ""
"Some uploads are music videos with intros or skits in the audio. Play the "
"song version instead when there is one."
msgstr "[Some uploads are music videos with intros or skits in the audio. Play the song version instead when there is one.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:783 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:24
msgid ""
"When a playlist, album or other list ends, play on with songs like its last "
"one. Off, the list starts again from the top. Repeat all always starts it "
"again."
msgstr "[When a playlist, album or other list ends, play on with songs like its last one. Off, the list starts again from the top. Repeat all always starts it again.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:786 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:31
msgid ""
"Radio and autoplay leave out user uploads and podcast episodes. Tracks you "
"pick always play."
msgstr "[Radio and autoplay leave out user uploads and podcast episodes. Tracks you pick always play.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:790 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:38
msgid "Skips the intros and outros SponsorBlock users marked in music videos."
msgstr "[Skips the intros and outros SponsorBlock users marked in music videos.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:792 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:45
msgid ""
"Playlists, albums and radio move past songs you've disliked. A song you pick "
"yourself still plays."
msgstr "[Playlists, albums and radio move past songs you've disliked. A song you pick yourself still plays.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:795 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:57
msgid ""
"Skips the silence before a song starts and after it ends. Everywhere also "
"shortens silences of 2 seconds or more inside a song."
msgstr "[Skips the silence before a song starts and after it ends. Everywhere also shortens silences of 2 seconds or more inside a song.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:798 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:67
msgid ""
"The end of a song fades into the next. Songs from the same album play "
"without a fade, and Next and Previous cut."
msgstr "[The end of a song fades into the next. Songs from the same album play without a fade, and Next and Previous cut.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:801 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:77
msgid ""
"Next, Previous and a click on another song fade over 2 seconds instead of "
"cutting."
msgstr "[Next, Previous and a click on another song fade over 2 seconds instead of cutting.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:804 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:89
msgid ""
"Adds a Sleep timer button to the player bar and to the tray menu, to pause "
"the music after a while."
msgstr "[Adds a Sleep timer button to the player bar and to the tray menu, to pause the music after a while.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:808 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:90
msgid ""
"Adds a Sleep timer button to the player bar, to pause the music after a "
"while."
msgstr "[Adds a Sleep timer button to the player bar, to pause the music after a while.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:813 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:108
msgid "Before the sleep timer pauses, the music fades out over this long."
msgstr "[Before the sleep timer pauses, the music fades out over this long.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:815 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:124
msgid ""
"Faster or slower, at the same pitch. While it isn't 1×, the player bar "
"shows it."
msgstr "[Faster or slower, at the same pitch. While it isn't 1×, the player bar shows it.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:819 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:134
msgid "How much the mouse wheel and the Up and Down keys change the volume."
msgstr "[How much the mouse wheel and the Up and Down keys change the volume.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:822 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:149
msgid ""
"A proxy is set, and it finds YouTube's servers itself, so this has no effect."
msgstr "[A proxy is set, and it finds YouTube's servers itself, so this has no effect.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:824 ui/pages/settings/playback.slint:150
msgid ""
"Asks a secure DNS service (Google's, or else Cloudflare's) where YouTube's "
"servers are, instead of your network's DNS. Turn on if songs can't play "
"because a DNS service routes YouTube abroad."
msgstr "[Asks a secure DNS service (Google's, or else Cloudflare's) where YouTube's servers are, instead of your network's DNS. Turn on if songs can't play because a DNS service routes YouTube abroad.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:827 ui/pages/settings/sound.slint:17
msgid "Shapes the sound of every song. Custom… lets you set each band."
msgstr "[Shapes the sound of every song. Custom… lets you set each band.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:828 ui/pages/settings/sound.slint:27
msgid ""
"Brings quiet parts up and loud parts down, for low volume or a noisy room. "
"Strong flattens a lot."
msgstr "[Brings quiet parts up and loud parts down, for low volume or a noisy room. Strong flattens a lot.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:831 ui/pages/settings/sound.slint:37
