"High plays Opus, which sounds better than AAC at about the same data use. "
"Standard always plays AAC at 128 kbps. Songs already loaded keep their "
"quality."
msgstr "[High plays Opus, which sounds better than AAC at about the same data use. Standard always plays AAC at 128 kbps. Songs already loaded keep their quality.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:838 ui/pages/settings/sound.slint:59
