msgstr "[Lines follow the song. While lyrics are on screen, LRCLIB gets the song's title, artist, album and length. Off: only the lyrics that come with the song, synced for some songs.]"

#: src/pages/settings/search.rs:846 ui/pages/settings/lyrics.slint:36
